# Decorative fountain basin water (Pegasus fountain, Mirabellgarten):
# light turquoise t with a teal T bottom band and w sparkles on little
# wavelets. Clearly decoration - bright and shallow, not the dark Salzach
# hazard water (b/B). 4 frames x 3 px shift = one 12 px wave period, so the
# loop is seamless; ripple dashes travel the other way.
sprite = fountain_water
size   = 48x8
origin = 24,8
anim   = idle frames=4 ticks=12 loop
